    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 12th, and every two levels thereafter, an astrologian learns further secrets to assist her in manipulating spells and other forms of magic. She may choose one of the following advanced astrology secrets in place of an astrology secret. Secrets marked with an asterisk add effects to an astrologian's spellcasting ability. Only one of these secrets can be applied to an individual spell and the decision must be made before the spell is cast.<br><br>A complete list of advanced astrology secrets can be found here: Advanced Astrology Secrets.</p>",
